<title>USA: Community Bank buying firm's plan accounts.</title>
<headline>Community Bank buying firm's plan accounts.</headline>
<dateline>SYRACUSE, N.Y. 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Community Bank System Inc said it has signed a letter of intent to buy the plan administration accounts of Pension Management Inc.</p>
<p>Terms of the proposed deal were  not disclosed.</p>
<p>The transaction is subject to, among other things, a due diligence review and negotiation of a definitive purchase agreement, it said.</p>
</text>
